{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":192303,"duration_api_ms":286458,"num_turns":16,"result":"The review is complete. All acceptance criteria are satisfied: 5 habitat/geometry probes with ecological doc comments, structured debug output, a summary runner that fails on violations, equipment scaling with paired 1x/2x runs at 40% tolerance, and directional/envelope assertions throughout. All four accepted amendments from the prior final review have been implemented. Tests and clippy are clean.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"f79ee998-2fb0-4d53-9497-77c3bb44105c","total_cost_usd":0.84546545,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":57610,"cache_read_input_tokens":318913,"output_tokens":4591,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":57610,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":195,"outputTokens":11370,"cacheReadInputTokens":756252,"cacheCreationInputTokens":62773,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.21113645000000006,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":7,"outputTokens":4591,"cacheReadInputTokens":318913,"cacheCreationInputTokens":57610,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.634329,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"approved","evidence":["All 5 habitat/geometry probes pass: biofilter_scaling, light_depth, habitat_fouling, substrate_redox, equipment_scaling — verified via `cargo test -p tank_harness --test e2e_habitat_geometry_probes` (6 tests: 5 individual + 1 summary, all green).","All 5 shrimp scenario probes pass: successful_breeding, thermal_suppression, chemistry_stress, chloride_protection, crash_mode — verified via `cargo test -p tank_harness --test e2e_shrimp_scenario_probes` (6 tests green).","Clippy clean: `cargo clippy -p tank_harness` produces zero warnings.","Each probe has a doc comment explaining the ecological mechanism: biofilter (media surface → nitrifier capacity), light-depth (Beer-Lambert attenuation), fouling (glass photosynthesis vs filter flow/organic load), redox (planted rhizosphere denitrification), scaling (proportional per-liter equivalence).","`all_habitat_geometry_probes_summary` runs all 5 probes, prints structured pass/fail report with observed values and failure detail, and returns Err on any failure (non-zero exit).","`format_habitat_debug` dumps 8 sections: habitat registry (area/flow/O2/light per habitat), periphyton by habitat, decomposer by habitat, nitrifier biomass, filter state, substrate layers with O2 penetration, denitrification metrics, and geometry dimensions.","Equipment scaling probe uses paired 1× vs 2× geometry with cubic stocking (10 → 80 adults), proportional feeding, identical hardware presets, and 40% concentration tolerance via `record_within_fraction()`.","Assertions are directional (e.g., `capacity_large > capacity_small * 1.25`, `growth_shallow > growth_deep`) and envelope-based (pH, temperature, TAN, DO ranges), not exact values.","Accepted amendments addressed: (1) thermal molt-stress inversion documented at lines 414-419, (2) redox nitrate floor guard at line 1293 with gated ratio comparison at line 1303, (3) breeding doc says 'should grow' matching strict `>` assertion at line 259 (initial=10 → final=260), (4) fouling ratio measurability precondition recorded as explicit check before ratio shift comparison.","The e2e_habitat_geometry_probes.rs file has no uncommitted changes — the `cargo fmt --check` diff is in biology.rs from a parallel project worktree (tanksim-6e5.6.4), unrelated to this deliverable."],"findings_or_gaps":["The `cargo fmt --check` diff in `crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs` is from uncommitted parallel worktree changes (tanksim-6e5.6.4), not from this project. When those changes merge, formatting should be applied.","The thermal probe's molt-stress inversion (cool=1.000, warm=0.351) is now documented but still represents an uninvestigated model behavior — cool colony breeding driving higher molt stress than thermal stress is mechanistically surprising and may warrant future model investigation.","The biofilter scaling probe's (None, None) fallback path reports ratio_change=0.00% in the summary even when neither filter clears, which could be slightly misleading but is not a functional issue since the fallback check is separately recorded."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["When merging parallel worktree changes (especially tanksim-6e5.6.4 biology.rs changes), run `cargo fmt --all` and re-validate the full habitat/geometry probe suite.","Consider investigating the thermal molt-stress inversion in a future model-tuning pass — the documented behavior (cool breeds harder → higher molt stress than heat alone) may indicate the molt stress model needs a direct thermal contribution separate from breeding frequency."]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"9fa2108a-e65f-4f77-bdb8-ed519c8d3466"}
